:: Revelation Robin Temple Joint Consent
<!-- ./src/twee/RobinTemple/Joint.twee -->
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RevelationRobinTemple.stage is 'member' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'
  and $robinromance is 1 and $sydneyromance is 1
  and $player.virginity.temple is true and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.temple is true>>
  <<lanSwitch
    'You ask Sydney to meet Robin in the side room. Robin says <<he>> will not ask Sydney to give up a promise already made. Sydney says the same of Robin.'
    '你请悉尼到侧室见罗宾。罗宾说，<<he>>不会要求悉尼放弃已经立下的誓言。悉尼也说，不会替罗宾作决定。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<lanSwitch
    'They ask what you want, then speak to each other without you prompting them. Jordan agrees to hear a request from all three, provided each person answers for their own vow.'
    '他们先问你想要什么，接着不等你插话，就各自把话说清楚。约旦愿意听你们三人的申请，但要求每个人为自己的誓言负责。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '与罗宾、悉尼一起提出申请' 'Revelation Robin Temple Promise Talk'>><<set $RevelationRobinTemple.joint_consent to true>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '让他们再考虑' 'Revelation Robin Temple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch
    'Robin will not turn this into a contest for your attention. Speak to Sydney about the vow you have already made before asking anyone to change it.'
    '罗宾不愿与你、悉尼争个先后。你该先和悉尼谈清已经立下的誓言，再请任何人考虑另一份承诺。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'Revelation Robin Temple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: Revelation Robin Temple Joint Rite
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RevelationRobinTemple.stage is 'approved' and $RevelationRobinTemple.joint_consent
  and $templePromised is 'Sydney' and $robinromance is 1 and $sydneyromance is 1
  and $player.virginity.temple is true and C.npc.Robin.virginity.temple is true
  and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.temple is true>>
  <<lanSwitch
    'Sydney arrives before Jordan calls you in. Robin checks once more that neither of you feels pressed to continue. You both answer in your own words.'
    '约旦请你们进去之前，悉尼赶到了。罗宾又问了一遍，是否有人觉得自己是在勉强答应。你和悉尼各自回答。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<lanSwitch
    'Jordan places a new page beside the record of your first promise. "If you proceed, I will hear three separate answers," Jordan says. Robin and Sydney stand on either side of you.'
    '约旦在你第一次立誓的记录旁放上新的一页。“若要继续，我会分别听你们三个人回答。”罗宾和悉尼站在你的两侧。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '三人一同立誓' 'Revelation Robin Temple Promise End'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '请求再多一点时间' 'Revelation Robin Temple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Someone is not ready to renew the request. Jordan leaves the record open for another day.' '有人还没有准备好再次提出申请。约旦把记录留待改日。'>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: Revelation Robin Temple Joint Reconcile
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RevelationRobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'
  and !$RevelationRobinTemple.joint_consent>>
  <<lanSwitch
    'Robin learns of your promise to Sydney from you, rather than from Jordan’s examination book. <<He>> asks Sydney to stay. They want to know what each of you understood when the second promise was made.'
    '罗宾从你口中得知你又与悉尼立了誓，而不是从约旦的检查簿里听说。<<He>>请悉尼留下，想弄清第二份誓言立下时，每个人究竟明白了什么。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<lanSwitch 'Jordan leaves the door open. No one can answer for the other two.' '约旦把门留着，没有人能替另外两人回答。'>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $robinromance is 1 and $sydneyromance is 1
    and $player.virginity.temple is true and C.npc.Robin.virginity.temple is true
    and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.temple is true>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '让三人分别说明自己的选择' 'Revelation Robin Temple Joint Agreement'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '承认无法同时遵守两份承诺' 'Revelation Robin Temple Joint Release'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '约改天继续谈' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is no unresolved promise to discuss.' '现在没有尚未谈清的誓言。'>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回大厅' 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: Revelation Robin Temple Joint Agreement
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RevelationRobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'
  and !$RevelationRobinTemple.joint_consent and $robinromance is 1 and $sydneyromance is 1
  and $player.virginity.temple is true and C.npc.Robin.virginity.temple is true
  and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.temple is true>>
  <<lanSwitch
    'Sydney says what <<he>> promised. Robin follows with <<his>> own words. You say what you can offer each of them, and what you cannot promise on anyone’s behalf.'
    '悉尼说出<<he>>立下的誓言，罗宾也用自己的话回答。你说清自己能为他们各自付出什么，也说清哪些事不能替任何人保证。'
  >>
  <br><br>
  <<lanSwitch
    'Jordan asks each of you once more. Only after all three answer does Jordan add a note to the record. Robin is still unsettled, but <<he>> takes Sydney’s offered hand.'
    '约旦又分别问了一遍。三个人都亲口答应后，约旦才在记录上添了说明。罗宾仍有些不安，却握住了悉尼伸来的手。'
  >>
  <<set $RevelationRobinTemple.joint_consent to true>>
  <<set $temple_chastity_timer to Math.min($temple_chastity_timer, 7)>>
  <br><br><span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'The three of you have agreed to the shared examination.' '你们三人同意一起接受检查。'>></span><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot settle this while one of the promises remains uncertain.' '其中一份誓言尚未厘清，现在不能作出共同决定。'>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Revelation Robin Temple Joint Release
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RevelationRobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'
  and !$RevelationRobinTemple.joint_consent>>
  <<set $RevelationRobinTemple.stage to 'member'>>
  <<set $temple_chastity_timer to Math.min($temple_chastity_timer, 7)>>
  <<lanSwitch
    'You tell Robin that you cannot keep both promises as they stand. <<He>> asks Jordan to strike the shared promise from the record, but keeps <<his>> place at the temple. "I needed to hear it from you," <<he>> says.'
    '你告诉罗宾，自己无法同时遵守现有的两份承诺。<<He>>请约旦划去与你共同立誓的记录，却仍留在神殿。“我需要听你亲口说。”<<he>>说。'
  >>
  <<npcincr Robin love -5>><br><br><<lllove>>
  <span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'Your shared promise to Robin has ended.' '你与罗宾共同立下的承诺已经结束。'>></span><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The record is already settled.' '这份记录已经处理过了。'>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>
